<h1><span class="mw-headline" id="Overview">Overview</span></h1>
<ul><li>Output voltage boosts along with the ambient ultraviolet intensity increases.</li>
<li>Onboard amplifier circuit with an adjustable amplification factor.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Specifications">Specifications</span></h2>
<ul><li>Chip: SGM8521</li>
<li>Voltage: 3.3V- 5V</li>
<li>Output type: Analog outout</li>
<li>Response spectrum: 200nm-370nm</li>
<li>Dimension: 22.0mm * 16.0mm</li>
<li>Mounting holes size: 2.0mm</li>
<li>Available distance: 0.8m (typ.), 1.5m(max)</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Applications">Applications</span></h2>
<ul><li>Ultraviolet tester</li>
<li>Outdoor ultraviolet detector</li>
<li>Germicidal lamp</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Pinouts">Pinouts</span></h2>
<p>In the case of working with a MCU:
</p>
<ul><li>VCC ↔ 3.3V ~ 5.0V</li>
<li>GND ↔ power supply ground</li>
<li>AOUT ↔ MCU.IO (analog output)</li></ul>
