<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Download_examples">Download examples</span></h2>
<p>Use Raspberry Pi as the host device. Open a terminal and run the following commands to download the example.
</p>
<pre>sudo apt-get install p7zip-full
cd ~
sudo wget  https://files.waveshare.com/upload/c/c5/UV-Sensor-code.7z
7z x UV-Sensor-code.7z -o./UV-Sensor-code
cd ~/UV-Sensor-code
